.env
Code/backend/instance/
Code/firmware/config.h
# EOG recordings, models, event logs and diagnostics are shared with the team (decided 2026-11-12;
# the repository is public). Backend credentials above stay private.
Code/runtime/
Code/launcher.local.json
Code/launcher-config.json
# ...except results the team chose to share (the *.csv rule above would hide the recordings)
!Code/acquisition/hardware-tests/**/*.csv
!Code/acquisition/data/**/*.csv

# React + Tailwind screens: dependencies and the build the backend serves (the launcher rebuilds it)
Code/frontend/node_modules/
Code/frontend/dist/
